# Mirrors .gitignore where it matters, but it is NOT the same list and cannot be
# replaced by one: Docker ignores .gitignore entirely, and the builder stage's
# `COPY . .` copies the working tree as it is on disk — including files git is
# ignoring. Anything left out here ends up in the build context, and anything
# under public/ is then copied into the runtime image and served publicly.

# Dependencies and build output are rebuilt inside the image. Copying the host's
# node_modules would also overwrite the deps stage's `npm ci` result with
# binaries built for the host's libc.
node_modules
.next
out
build

# Secrets. No .env file is committed today, but one created locally must never
# reach an image layer — layers survive deletion and travel with the image.
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Video masters. These are the reason this file exists.
#
# public/media/ holds both the committed web encodes (hero-*.mp4, reels/) and
# the multi-hundred-megabyte masters they were cut from. The masters are in
# .gitignore, so they are absent from a fresh clone but present on any machine
# that ran the media seed — including this one, where the banner master alone is
# 123 MB. Without the two patterns below that file is copied into the build
# context, baked into the runtime image via `COPY /app/public ./public`, and
# served at /media/Desktop%20Banner_1080.mp4.
#
# Keep in sync with .gitignore and with the OUTPUTS table in scripts/seed-media.mjs.
public/media/*_source.*
public/media/Desktop Banner_1080.mp4

# Brand source masters (.eps, full-resolution logo art). Never served — the
# site uses public/logo.png and public/logo-mark.png.
design

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling and metadata with no role at runtime.
.git
.gitignore
.agents
.claude
skills-lock.json
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# The deploy definitions themselves. Including them would invalidate the build
# cache on every edit to a file the image never reads.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
.woodpecker.yml

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
npm-debug.log*
